    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a simulator for driving a car, piloting a helicopter, airplane, and spaceship. It features an open world spanning 750 square kilometers. The game includes several cities and diverse locations such as mountains, a desert, and lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of racing tracks for cars and plenty of airports and free-flight plane opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose between two playable characters.</p>",
